  "html": "<div id=\"BUV\" class=\"uplift front\">\n<section id=\"course-front-body\" class=\"responsive-padding\" style=\"color: #2d3b45; background: none; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px;\">\n<article id=\"course-lesson-intro-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 36pt;\">Design Practice &amp; Strategy (A): Applied Strategic Communication</span><br>\n<p>In this module, students will devise an integrated strategy to realise a self-initiated brief and tailor their learning to their areas of interest. This approach serves to enrich communication skills while focusing on specific interests, fostering an environment of personal and professional growth.&nbsp;</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"grid-row\">\n<article class=\"col-lg-4 buv-responsive-video-100\" style=\"padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\"><iframe class=\"lti-embed\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 300px; display: inline-block;\" title=\"DPAS(A) - Canvas Uplift video\" src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7305/external_tools/retrieve?display=borderless&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbuv.instructuremedia.com%2Flti%2Flaunch%3Fcustom_arc_launch_type%3Dlearn_embed%26custom_arc_media_id%3Dba12760b-e5df-4cbf-8486-026a76b5d646-34843%26custom_arc_start_at%3D0\" width=\"480\" height=\"278\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"webkitallowfullscreen\" mozallowfullscreen=\"mozallowfullscreen\" allow=\"geolocation *; microphone *; camera *; midi *; encrypted-media *; autoplay *; clipboard-write *; display-capture *; fullscreen *\" data-titletext=\"DPAS(A) - Canvas Uplift video\" data-studio-resizable=\"true\" data-studio-tray-enabled=\"true\" data-studio-convertible-to-link=\"true\"></iframe></article>\n<article class=\"col-lg-8\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding-left: 12px;\">\n<h3><strong>Learning Objectives for this module:</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Formulate a comprehensive design brief, demonstrating an understanding of key components required for a design project.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Use strategic capabilities by integrating a custom strategy to realising a design brief</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Display critical thinking and professional communication skills through a visual report and pitch presentation</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Evidence autonomous learning and professional growth through own reflection</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-row responsive-padding\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; margin-bottom: -50px;\">\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 12px;\"><strong>Module Content:</strong></h3>\n</div>"
